      "body": [
        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "value": "\n<ol><li dir=\"ltr\">the esteemed, prince of the house of Israel [may the Rock of] Israel</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">[assist him], married Sitt al-Dal\u0101l, (who was) sing[le],</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">daughter of (our) master \u02bfUlla, who is known as the \"Trusted (official) of the S[tate].\"\u00a0</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">And he took her in complete qiddushin. And w[e] hereby</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">copy the text of her marriage contract, after [it] had been [verified]</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">in our presence as is proper. This is its text, letter</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">for letter, except the verses which are\u00a0\u00a0</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">above ... marriage contract. On the second day\u00a0</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">of the week, ten days in the month Sheva\u1e6d,\u00a0\u00a0</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">year four thousand, eight hundred\u00a0\u00a0</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">and sixty A.M.,\u00a0\u00a0</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">this marriage contract was written in the [ci]ty of\u00a0\u00a0</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">Ashkelon which is situated on the shore of the great sea.</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\u2018I\u2014(his) h(onor), g(reatness and) h(oliness) (our) master and l(ord)\u2014Shelah\u2014may He who dwells on high\u00a0</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">bless him and grant him fame and praise on earth,</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">prince of the house of Israel, may the Rock of Israel assist him\u00a0 </li></ol>\n",
          "format": "text/html"
        }
      ],
      "motivation": [
        "sc:supplementing",
        "translating"
      ],
      "schema:position": 1
    },
